    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Frosted</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a magical roguelite shooter filled with fast-paced combat and endless discovery. Play as Ursula, a fearless young girl exploring a mysterious enchanted world, where every run brings new challenges, powerful artifacts, and hidden secrets to uncover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346350/extras/5db1e35859339f2a189b1750002de612.poster.avif?t=1744674207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346350/extras/5db1e35859339f2a189b1750002de612.webm?t=1744674207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A World of Dangers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through distinct biomes filled with deadly monsters and unpredictable bosses. From frozen wastelands to towering peaks and shadowy forests, every corner of the world holds new challenges and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346350/extras/8c13be036fdc8b28765e0709a81a105d.poster.avif?t=1744674207\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1346350/extras/8c13be036fdc8b28765e0709a81a105d.webm?t=1744674207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Story of Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ursula\u2019s journey is a test of sacrifice and determination. Your decisions shape the story\u2014will she stay true to herself, or lose her grip on reality in pursuit of the Greater Good? But what truly is the &quot;right&quot; choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div 